{"4679450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Farming & Supermarket: Clicker", "steam_appid": 4679450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4758900], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARVEST, PRODUCE, AND BUILD YOUR SUPERMARKET EMPIRE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming &amp; Supermarket: Clicker</strong> blends addictive clicker mechanics with deep tycoon management. Experience the perfect harmony of farm-fresh harvesting and fast-paced retail action!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Click to Harvest!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your fingers to work! Harvest your crops from the fields with simple clicks. The faster you click, the faster you grow. Once harvested, stock your shelves and offer fresh products to your customers instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/22b4dc1d79f9634accee677d24bbaddf.poster.avif?t=1784893639\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/22b4dc1d79f9634accee677d24bbaddf.webm?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/22b4dc1d79f9634accee677d24bbaddf.mp4?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Production</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just settle for raw materials! Use advanced machinery to process your goods and create high-value products. Turn your tomatoes into ketchup and your wheat into fresh bread to skyrocket your profit margins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/27a6fdf802dad21fbe935374647f4684.poster.avif?t=1784893639\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/27a6fdf802dad21fbe935374647f4684.webm?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/27a6fdf802dad21fbe935374647f4684.mp4?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Livestock &amp; Farming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great market needs variety! Feed and care for your animals to produce essential farm goods. Expand your product range and diversify your supermarket by managing your very own livestock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/d151b997d6cf08ce9864babb9c1623c6.poster.avif?t=1784893639\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/d151b997d6cf08ce9864babb9c1623c6.webm?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/d151b997d6cf08ce9864babb9c1623c6.mp4?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Art of Fishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your rod and enjoy the calm waters... or use your clicking speed to sweep the sea floor! Catch rare fish to fill your supermarket's gourmet section with premium seafood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/89ef1b34f3bfb443a84b65471484d6cf.poster.avif?t=1784893639\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/89ef1b34f3bfb443a84b65471484d6cf.webm?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/89ef1b34f3bfb443a84b65471484d6cf.mp4?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customer Rush &amp; Golden Rain!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your supermarket gains fame, customers will flock to your store! Watch them grab your products and leave behind a satisfying trail of coins. Collecting the gold is just as fun as spending it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/f9f5f1ace8484795ee41bad77c45df17.poster.avif?t=1784893639\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/f9f5f1ace8484795ee41bad77c45df17.webm?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/f9f5f1ace8484795ee41bad77c45df17.mp4?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design Your Own Supermarket</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layout is everything! Strategically place your shelves to manage customer flow and maximize your store's efficiency. A well-organized market is a profitable one.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/5a4bb3f576655ed97a297eb260a54d5b.poster.avif?t=1784893639\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/5a4bb3f576655ed97a297eb260a54d5b.webm?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/5a4bb3f576655ed97a297eb260a54d5b.mp4?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND YOUR STRATEGY, GROW YOUR TRADE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn and Innovate (Learn NPC):</strong> Unlock the future! Visit the Learn NPC to discover complex recipes and advanced production methods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and Evolve (Upgrade NPC):</strong> Boost your click power, movement speed, and storage capacity. Scale your operations until you can manage a massive empire single-handedly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workers &amp; Automation:</strong> Why do all the heavy lifting? Hire workers to automate your production lines. Focus on the big strategy while your shop runs itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Trade: Ship Exports:</strong> Prepare for the giant cargo ships at the docks! Fulfill massive bulk orders and build a fortune through international trade.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Farming &amp; Supermarket: Clicker?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love stress-free gaming, watching things grow step-by-step, and building your own business kingdom, you're in the right place. Start with a single click, and evolve into a global trade tycoon!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARVEST, PRODUCE, AND BUILD YOUR SUPERMARKET EMPIRE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming &amp; Supermarket: Clicker</strong> blends addictive clicker mechanics with deep tycoon management. Experience the perfect harmony of farm-fresh harvesting and fast-paced retail action!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Click to Harvest!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your fingers to work! Harvest your crops from the fields with simple clicks. The faster you click, the faster you grow. Once harvested, stock your shelves and offer fresh products to your customers instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/22b4dc1d79f9634accee677d24bbaddf.poster.avif?t=1784893639\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/22b4dc1d79f9634accee677d24bbaddf.webm?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/22b4dc1d79f9634accee677d24bbaddf.mp4?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Production</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just settle for raw materials! Use advanced machinery to process your goods and create high-value products. Turn your tomatoes into ketchup and your wheat into fresh bread to skyrocket your profit margins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/27a6fdf802dad21fbe935374647f4684.poster.avif?t=1784893639\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/27a6fdf802dad21fbe935374647f4684.webm?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/27a6fdf802dad21fbe935374647f4684.mp4?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Livestock &amp; Farming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great market needs variety! Feed and care for your animals to produce essential farm goods. Expand your product range and diversify your supermarket by managing your very own livestock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/d151b997d6cf08ce9864babb9c1623c6.poster.avif?t=1784893639\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/d151b997d6cf08ce9864babb9c1623c6.webm?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/d151b997d6cf08ce9864babb9c1623c6.mp4?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Art of Fishing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your rod and enjoy the calm waters... or use your clicking speed to sweep the sea floor! Catch rare fish to fill your supermarket's gourmet section with premium seafood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/89ef1b34f3bfb443a84b65471484d6cf.poster.avif?t=1784893639\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/89ef1b34f3bfb443a84b65471484d6cf.webm?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/89ef1b34f3bfb443a84b65471484d6cf.mp4?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customer Rush &amp; Golden Rain!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your supermarket gains fame, customers will flock to your store! Watch them grab your products and leave behind a satisfying trail of coins. Collecting the gold is just as fun as spending it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/f9f5f1ace8484795ee41bad77c45df17.poster.avif?t=1784893639\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/f9f5f1ace8484795ee41bad77c45df17.webm?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/f9f5f1ace8484795ee41bad77c45df17.mp4?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design Your Own Supermarket</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layout is everything! Strategically place your shelves to manage customer flow and maximize your store's efficiency. A well-organized market is a profitable one.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/5a4bb3f576655ed97a297eb260a54d5b.poster.avif?t=1784893639\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/5a4bb3f576655ed97a297eb260a54d5b.webm?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/extras/5a4bb3f576655ed97a297eb260a54d5b.mp4?t=1784893639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND YOUR STRATEGY, GROW YOUR TRADE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn and Innovate (Learn NPC):</strong> Unlock the future! Visit the Learn NPC to discover complex recipes and advanced production methods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and Evolve (Upgrade NPC):</strong> Boost your click power, movement speed, and storage capacity. Scale your operations until you can manage a massive empire single-handedly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workers &amp; Automation:</strong> Why do all the heavy lifting? Hire workers to automate your production lines. Focus on the big strategy while your shop runs itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Trade: Ship Exports:</strong> Prepare for the giant cargo ships at the docks! Fulfill massive bulk orders and build a fortune through international trade.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Farming &amp; Supermarket: Clicker?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love stress-free gaming, watching things grow step-by-step, and building your own business kingdom, you're in the right place. Start with a single click, and evolve into a global trade tycoon!</p>", "short_description": "Click, harvest, and build your own retail empire! In Farming &amp; Supermarket: Clicker, process raw crops into valuable goods, design your store, and sell to customers. Start with a simple click and grow into a massive supermarket tycoon!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/1ca13f78d849e8edca1df50a7668847c1db744cb/header.jpg?t=1784893639", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/73b630ae72cd6dbc3c99bdf20dc9f3ecefd9ac3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784893639", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679450/73b630ae72cd6dbc3c99bdf20dc9f3ecefd9ac3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784893639", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB video memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requi